    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>BRAINKILLED - The Puzzle Game That Wants You to Fail!\u00a0</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you're smart? Brainkilled will test that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <u><strong>Game 1: Logic &amp; Observation puzzles</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sharp logic and keen observation, interact with elements to solve puzzles where clues can be hidden anywhere - in the environment, in the rules, or even in what you're not being told</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>Game 2: The Math Challenge</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a brutal set of math-based puzzles, ranging from basic to advanced maths. You will need real math skills, not just pattern matching!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Modes, one brain!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Hidden Levels</strong></u>\u00a0and <u><strong>Secret Riddles\u00a0</strong></u> need to be discovered!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. You will fail, learn and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each level, you have to <strong><u>find the password</u></strong> in order to procceed to the next one. <u><strong>Padlocks</strong></u> will inform you about the form of the password (letters, numbers ect)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the mind to survive or you are going to get\u00a0<i>Brainkilled?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try... and see how long it lasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Have you seen the trailer of the game?\u00a0</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might need to take a second look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>BRAINKILLED - The Puzzle Game That Wants You to Fail!\u00a0</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you're smart? Brainkilled will test that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <u><strong>Game 1: Logic &amp; Observation puzzles</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sharp logic and keen observation, interact with elements to solve puzzles where clues can be hidden anywhere - in the environment, in the rules, or even in what you're not being told</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>Game 2: The Math Challenge</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a brutal set of math-based puzzles, ranging from basic to advanced maths. You will need real math skills, not just pattern matching!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Modes, one brain!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Hidden Levels</strong></u>\u00a0and <u><strong>Secret Riddles\u00a0</strong></u> need to be discovered!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. You will fail, learn and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each level, you have to <strong><u>find the password</u></strong> in order to procceed to the next one. <u><strong>Padlocks</strong></u> will inform you about the form of the password (letters, numbers ect)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the mind to survive or you are going to get\u00a0<i>Brainkilled?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try... and see how long it lasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Have you seen the trailer of the game?\u00a0</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might need to take a second look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
